{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a hand-drawn and animated world where your mission is simple: <strong>find all the cats!</strong> Explore lively environments, trigger surprising interactions, and keep your eyes peeled to spot every detail. Observation is key to uncover these mischievous felines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.poster.avif?t=1767463149\" width=800 height=531 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.webm?t=1767463149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip through the pages of a notebook and explore <strong>around 20 different levels</strong>, gradually filling your wagons with all the cats you discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, time is ticking. Once a level starts, you only have a short while before the storm catches up. Thankfully, some characters are there to help, and a hint system is available if you get stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you manage to find them all, a final challenge awaits. <strong>Agent Neige, a camouflage expert cat, is hiding in each level. Can you spot them all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the creators of Oddada, a game that made it possible for me to compose the entire soundtrack.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324060?t=1767463149","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324060?t=1767463149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/4c159877596852ff977219ce9673e78a33a55e92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767463149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/4c159877596852ff977219ce9673e78a33a55e92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767463149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4099190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a hand-drawn and animated world where your mission is simple: <strong>find all the cats!</strong> Explore lively environments, trigger surprising interactions, and keep your eyes peeled to spot every detail. Observation is key to uncover these mischievous felines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.poster.avif?t=1767463149\" width=800 height=531 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.webm?t=1767463149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip through the pages of a notebook and explore <strong>around 20 different levels</strong>, gradually filling your wagons with all the cats you discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, time is ticking. Once a level starts, you only have a short while before the storm catches up. Thankfully, some characters are there to help, and a hint system is available if you get stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you manage to find them all, a final challenge awaits. <strong>Agent Neige, a camouflage expert cat, is hiding in each level. Can you spot them all?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the creators of Oddada, a game that made it possible for me to compose the entire soundtrack.</p>","developers":["Balgrime Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/header.jpg?t=1767463149","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324060/1423699279/7f703d6ca105872fae9c1e76ccbcca36ddb9436c/1760295136/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760297192","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324060/1423699279/7f703d6ca105872fae9c1e76ccbcca36ddb9436c/1760295136/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760297192","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324060/1423699279/7f703d6ca105872fae9c1e76ccbcca36ddb9436c/1760295136/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760297192","id":257216559,"name":"Trailer Seek and Click","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216559/a7c78b7cf5cfada99a5f530fa9392c89d1365e42/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760297192"}],"name":"Seek and Click","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</stro